 R←Test_SendEmail_57(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;log;text
⍝ A server that sends its response to EHLO in two parts, as Gmail does
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 ∆SERVER.SplitEHLO←1
 parms←∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 (rc msg log text)←∆Send parms
 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf 1=≢∆SERVER.Logons
 →T.PassesIf 1=≢∆SERVER.Messages

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
